  "hero_headline": "美联储时隔三年首次加息，全球金融市场震荡引发连锁反应 / Fed Hikes Rates After Three Years, Triggering Global Market Volatility",
  "daily_overview": "科技领域中，AI产业生态正从模型竞赛向应用落地转型，具身智能与科研辅助agent成为新焦点，但算力基础设施投资热潮伴随泡沫风险；财经端，美联储宣布三年来的首次加息，引发全球债市收益率上行，叠加贸易保护主义抬头，各国经济正面临财政失衡与地缘冲突引发的粮食供应风险；时政方面，美国对伊朗冲突局势维持高压，同时处理涉及加拿大贸易禁令及国内人事变动，全球地缘政治格局正处于剧烈动荡与重新洗牌的关键时期。\n\nIn the tech sector, the AI ecosystem is shifting from model competitions to real-world applications, with embodied intelligence and scientific research agents becoming new focal points, though the infrastructure boom carries significant bubble risks. Financially, the Fed has hiked rates for the first time in three years, driving up global bond yields; combined with rising protectionism, economies face fiscal imbalances and food supply risks from geopolitical conflicts. Politically, the U.S. continues to manage tensions with Iran, trade friction with Canada, and domestic personnel shifts, signaling a period of intense global geopolitical realignment.",
